<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram name="기계 구성과 시나리오 흐름"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2860" pageHeight="2960" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="p0s0" value="&lt;b&gt;웹캠 노트북 ×2&lt;/b&gt;　[구현]&lt;br&gt;camera_open (개방구역) · camera_alley (골목)&lt;br&gt;vision_detector — USB 카메라를 직접 읽는다&lt;br&gt;YOLO11n rescue_yolo11n.pt (fallen_person · helper)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=14;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="120" width="500" height="118" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0s1" value="&lt;b&gt;중앙 관제 PC  192.168.107.122&lt;/b&gt;　[일부 구현]&lt;br&gt;Fast DDS Discovery Server :11811&lt;br&gt;mission_manager · location_mapper(뼈대)&lt;br&gt;aed_hmi — FastAPI :8000 + SQLite + aed_hmi_bridge" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=14;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="620" y="120" width="560" height="118" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0s2" value="&lt;b&gt;로봇 제어 PC ×2&lt;/b&gt;　[일부 구현]&lt;br&gt;mission_executor · robot_state_monitor(뼈대)&lt;br&gt;Nav2 — bt_navigator · planner · controller · AMCL&lt;br&gt;turtlebot4_navigation nav2.launch.py namespace:=/robotN" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=14;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1240" y="120" width="560" height="118" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0s3" value="&lt;b&gt;TurtleBot4 ×2&lt;/b&gt;　[하드웨어]&lt;br&gt;Create3 + Raspberry Pi&lt;br&gt;RPLIDAR · OAK-D Pro · 배터리 · Dock&lt;br&gt;AED 적재" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=14;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1860" y="120" width="480" height="118" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0s4" value="&lt;b&gt;운영자 브라우저&lt;/b&gt;　[구현]&lt;br&gt;React + TypeScript :5173&lt;br&gt;ROS 미설치" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2;dashed=0;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=14;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2400" y="120" width="400" height="118" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0s5" value="&lt;b&gt;/{robot_id}/odom  ·  /battery_state  ·  /dock_status  ·  /scan&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;nav_msgs/Odometry · sensor_msgs/BatteryState · irobot_create_msgs/DockStatus · sensor_msgs/LaserScan&lt;br&gt;BEST_EFFORT depth 10 — 센서는 최신값만 의미가 있어 밀리면 버린다" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;fontSize=13;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1536" y="338" width="548" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0s6" value="&lt;b&gt;/aed/robot_state    ← 발행하는 노드가 없다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;aed_interfaces/RobotState · RELIABLE depth 20 · 2 Hz 예정&lt;br&gt;robot_state_monitor 가 29줄 뼈대라 관제의 로봇 카드가 빈칸으로 남는다" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;fontSize=13;fontColor=#C0392B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="916" y="454" width="588" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0s7" value="&lt;b&gt;WebSocket  ws://호스트:8000/ws/live&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;SystemSnapshot JSON · 0.25초마다 · 로봇·사건·임무·영상 상태 한 장" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;fontSize=13;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="916" y="570" width="1668" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0s8" value="&lt;b&gt;USB 카메라 → vision_detector   같은 프로세스 · DDS 안 거침&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;cv2.VideoCapture → numpy BGR uint8[480,640,3] · 15 Hz&lt;br&gt;확정 규칙: 최근 10프레임 중 6프레임 이상 검출 · rescue_conf 0.25" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;fontSize=13;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="332" y="734" width="450" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0s9" value="&lt;b&gt;/{camera_id}/vision/emergency_event&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;aed_interfaces/EmergencyEvent · RELIABLE depth 10&lt;br&gt;상태가 바뀔 때만 (DETECTED → CONFIRMED → RESOLVED)&lt;br&gt;location.point 는 아직 0,0 — 호모그래피 변환이 안 붙었다" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;fontSize=13;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="326" y="850" width="558" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0s10" value="&lt;b&gt;/{camera_id}/vision/debug/compressed   ·   /vision/person_count&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;sensor_msgs/CompressedImage · BEST_EFFORT depth 1 · 15 Hz&lt;br&gt;std_msgs/UInt32 · RELIABLE depth 10 — 화면 타일의 검출 표시" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;fontSize=13;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="326" y="986" width="558" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0s11" value="&lt;b&gt;location_mapper   ← 29줄 뼈대. 여기서 흐름이 끊긴다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;카메라별 토픽을 /aed/emergency_event 로 중계해야 한다&lt;br&gt;mission_manager 는 그 토픽을 듣고 있으나 아무것도 안 온다" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;fontSize=13;fontColor=#C0392B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="922" y="1170" width="480" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0s12" value="&lt;b&gt;mission_manager._assign_next()&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;가용: availability=AVAILABLE ∧ network_ok ∧ nav2_ok ∧ path_valid&lt;br&gt;순위: rank_candidates() — estimated_path_cost 오름차순 · 1대만 배정" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;fontSize=13;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="922" y="1286" width="480" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0s13" value="&lt;b&gt;/{robot_id}/mission_assignment&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;aed_interfaces/MissionAssignment · RELIABLE depth 10&lt;br&gt;목표 좌표는 이 메시지에만 실린다 (MissionStatus 에는 상태만 있다)&lt;br&gt;cancel_previous=true 면 받는 쪽이 기존 Nav2 goal 을 취소한다" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;fontSize=13;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="916" y="1402" width="588" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0s14" value="&lt;b&gt;/aed/mission_status    ASSIGNED → DISPATCHING&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;aed_interfaces/MissionStatus · RELIABLE depth 10&lt;br&gt;상태 14종. 한 번만 오므로 놓치면 그 기록이 영영 없다" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;fontSize=13;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="916" y="1538" width="588" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0s15" value="&lt;b&gt;/{robot_id}/navigate_to_pose    Topic 아님 · Action&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;nav2_msgs/action/NavigateToPose&lt;br&gt;goal PoseStamped(map) / feedback 남은 거리 / result 성공·실패" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;fontSize=13;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1542" y="1722" width="480" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0s16" value="&lt;b&gt;/{robot_id}/cmd_vel&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;geometry_msgs/Twist · 최대 선속도 0.20 m/s (nav2_aed.yaml)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;fontSize=13;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1536" y="1838" width="548" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0s17" value="&lt;b&gt;/{robot_id}/oakd/rgb/image_raw/compressed&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;sensor_msgs/CompressedImage · BEST_EFFORT depth 1&lt;br&gt;로봇 시점 영상. 로봇 쪽 검출 노드는 아직 없어 원본만 나온다" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;fontSize=13;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="916" y="1934" width="1168" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0s18" value="&lt;b&gt;/aed/mission_status    EN_ROUTE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;aed_interfaces/MissionStatus · RELIABLE depth 10" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;fontSize=13;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="916" y="2050" width="588" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0s19" value="&lt;b&gt;WebSocket 0.25초   +   MJPEG /api/video/{stream_id}&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;경보 배너 · 도착 예상(ETA) · 로봇 카드 · 4분할 영상&lt;br&gt;ETA = 남은 거리 ÷ 실측 속도. 못 믿을 때는 순항 0.20 m/s 로 갈음" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;fontSize=13;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="916" y="2146" width="1668" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0s20" value="&lt;b&gt;/aed/mission_status    BLOCKED | NETWORK_LOST | NAVIGATION_ERROR&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;aed_interfaces/MissionStatus · reason 에 사유 문자열이 실린다" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;fontSize=13;fontColor=#C0392B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="916" y="2330" width="588" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0s21" value="&lt;b&gt;/{robot_id}/mission_assignment    assignment_version = 2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;aed_interfaces/MissionAssignment · cancel_previous=true&lt;br&gt;실패한 로봇을 후보에서 빼고 차순위에게 다시 보낸다" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;fontSize=13;fontColor=#C0392B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="916" y="2426" width="588" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0s22" value="&lt;b&gt;/aed/mission_status    ARRIVED → COMPLETED&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;aed_interfaces/MissionStatus · RELIABLE depth 10" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;fontSize=13;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="916" y="2610" width="588" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0s23" value="&lt;b&gt;context.on_*  —  같은 값이 두 갈래로 간다&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ⓐ 메모리(LiveState) → WebSocket 0.25초      지금 상태&lt;br&gt;Ⓑ SQLite(Repository) → REST 5초             일어난 일" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;fontSize=13;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="922" y="2706" width="480" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0s24" value="&lt;b&gt;GET /api/missions · /api/stats/response-time · /stats/eta-accuracy&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;출동 이력과 통계. 임무 요약은 저장하지 않고 상태 전이에서 되짚는다" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacing=0;fontSize=13;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="916" y="2822" width="1668" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0s25" value="&lt;b&gt;P0  대기&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;로봇은 Dock 에서 AED 를 싣고 기다린다" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=15;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="270" width="2780" height="378" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0s26" value="&lt;b&gt;P1  감지&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;쓰러진 사람을 웹캠이 본다" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=15;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="666" width="2780" height="418" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0s27" value="&lt;b&gt;P2  확정 · 배정&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;중앙이 후보를 세우고 한 대만 보낸다" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=15;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1102" width="2780" height="534" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0s28" value="&lt;b&gt;P3  이동&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Nav2 가 목표까지 몬다" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=15;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1654" width="2780" height="590" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0s29" value="&lt;b&gt;P4  장애 · 재할당&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;가던 로봇이 못 가면 다른 한 대가 간다" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=15;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2262" width="2780" height="262" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0s30" value="&lt;b&gt;P5  도착 · 종료&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;AED 전달이 끝나면 기록이 남는다" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=4;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 5;fontSize=15;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2542" width="2780" height="358" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e0" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=2.6;edgeStyle=none;dashed=0;dashPattern=8 5;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="2100" y="414" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1520" y="414" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e1" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=